      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes sense. i've been pretty stressed lately with work so tension seems way more likely than anything serious. do u think i should just try some muscle relaxants or maybe some ibuprofen to see if it goes away before i bother calling a doctor? i really don't want to deal with an appointment for something that's probably just a sore jaw.",
